<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Getting started on Spine Event Engine</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/</link><description>Recent content in Getting started on Spine Event Engine</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><atom:link href="https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Adding to build</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/adding-to-build/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/adding-to-build/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="adding-validation-to-a-gradle-build" data-title&gt;&#10;Adding Validation to a Gradle build&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="adding-spine-specific-gradle-plugin-repositories" data-title&gt;&#10;Adding Spine-specific Gradle plugin repositories&lt;span class="nowrap-icon"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="anchor-icon" href=#adding-spine-specific-gradle-plugin-repositories&#10; aria-label="Copy heading anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;embed-code &#10;file="$examples/settings.gradle.kts" &#10;start="pluginManagement {" &#10;end="^}"&gt;&#10;&lt;/embed-code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-kotlin" data-lang="kotlin"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pluginManagement&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;repositories&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;mavenLocal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;gradlePluginPortal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;maven&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://europe-maven.pkg.dev/spine-event-engine/snapshots&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;maven&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://europe-maven.pkg.dev/spine-event-engine/releases&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The repositories at &lt;a href="https://europe-maven.pkg.dev"&#10; &#10; &#10; class="external-link"&#10; target="_blank"&#10; rel="noopener nofollow"&#10; &gt;https://europe-maven.pkg.dev&lt;/a&gt; are needed to obtain versions of&#10;Spine tools and libraries that are not yet published to the Gradle Plugin Portal or Maven Central.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="optional-adding-spine-specific-maven-repositories" data-title&gt;&#10;Optional: adding Spine-specific Maven repositories&lt;span class="nowrap-icon"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="anchor-icon" href=#optional-adding-spine-specific-maven-repositories&#10; aria-label="Copy heading anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Similar to the plugin repositories, a project using Validation may need artifacts that&#10;are not yet published to Maven Central. Our Gradle plugins take care of this by adding the&#10;necessary repositories to the project when applied. Normally, you don&amp;rsquo;t need to add&#10;repositories manually when using the plugins.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Building project</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/build-project/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/build-project/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="build-your-project" data-title&gt;&#10;Build your project&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;After you added Validation to the build and declared constraints in your Protobuf model,&#10;run your Gradle build as usual.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;For macOS and Linux:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./gradlew clean build&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;For Windows:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-powershell" data-lang="powershell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;gradlew&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="py"&gt;bat&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;clean&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;build&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Validation Gradle plugin integrates with Spine Compiler, scans your model, and injects&#10;validation checks into the generated JVM code.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The generated sources will appear in the &lt;code&gt;generated&lt;/code&gt; directory next to the &lt;code&gt;src&lt;/code&gt; directory.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;clean&lt;/code&gt; task is optional and is relevant when Protobuf code changes.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Defining constraints</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/first-model/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/first-model/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="define-constraints-in-proto-files" data-title&gt;&#10;Define constraints in &lt;code&gt;.proto&lt;/code&gt; files&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This guide shows how to import Spine Validation options and declare constraints&#10;in your Protobuf model.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The validation options come from &lt;code&gt;spine/options.proto&lt;/code&gt; and include constraints like&#10;&lt;code&gt;(required)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;(min)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;(max)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;(pattern)&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;(distinct)&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;(validate)&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="import-options-and-declare-constraints" data-title&gt;&#10;Import options and declare constraints&lt;span class="nowrap-icon"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="anchor-icon" href=#import-options-and-declare-constraints&#10; aria-label="Copy heading anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Create a &lt;code&gt;.proto&lt;/code&gt; file and import &lt;code&gt;spine/options.proto&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;embed-code &#10;file="$examples/first-model/src/main/proto/spine/validation/docs/first_model/bank_card.proto" &#10;start="syntax" &#10;end="^}"&gt;&#10;&lt;/embed-code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-protobuf" data-lang="protobuf"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;syntax&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;proto3&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;package&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nn"&gt;spine.validation.docs.first_model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kn"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;spine/options.proto&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;type_url_prefix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;type.spine.io&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;java_package&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;io.spine.validation.docs.firstmodel&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;option&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;java_multiple_files&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Provides bank card information with validation rules.&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;//&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;// The digits of the card are simplified for the sake of the example.&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;//&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;message&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nc"&gt;BankCard&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// The digits of the card number.&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;//&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Must be present and match a 16-digit card number formatted as four&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// groups of four digits separated by spaces (for example, &amp;#34;1234 5678 1234 5678&amp;#34;).&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;//&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;digits&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;regex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;^\\d{4}(?: \\d{4}){3}&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;];&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// The name of the card owner.&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;//&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Must be present, contain at least 4 characters, start with a Latin letter,&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// and have exactly one space between words.&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;//&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;owner&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;regex&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;^(?=.{4,})[A-Z][A-Za-z]*(?: [A-Za-z]+)+$&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;];&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// All tags must be unique. Tags are optional.&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;repeated&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;tags&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mi"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;distinct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kc"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;];&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Notes on the options used:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Using the generated code</title><link>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/generated-code/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://spine.io/docs/validation/user/01-getting-started/generated-code/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="using-the-generated-code" data-title&gt;&#10;Using the generated code&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This guide shows how the generated JVM API enforces constraints at runtime.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Validation runs automatically when a message is created.&#10;It is also possible to validate an existing instance.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="validation-on-creation" data-title&gt;&#10;Validation on creation&lt;span class="nowrap-icon"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="anchor-icon" href=#validation-on-creation&#10; aria-label="Copy heading anchor"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;When a message violates declared constraints, &lt;code&gt;build()&lt;/code&gt; throws &lt;code&gt;ValidationException&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="code-block code-tabs "&#10; &gt;&#10; &lt;div class="code-block-header tabs "&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="indicator"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="tab" lang="kotlin"&gt;Kotlin&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;div class="tab" lang="java"&gt;Java&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="code-wrapper code-tab-content" lang="kotlin"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;p&gt;&lt;embed-code &#10;file="$examples/first-model/src/test/kotlin/io/spine/validation/docs/firstmodel/BankCardKtTest.kt" &#10;fragment="invalid-digits"&gt;&#10;&lt;/embed-code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-kotlin" data-lang="kotlin"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;shouldThrow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;ValidationException&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;// Kotlin proto DSL delegates to a Java builder.&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;bankCard&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;digits&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;invalid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;owner&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;ALEX SMITH&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;div class="code-wrapper code-tab-content" lang="java"&gt;&#10; &#10; &#10; &lt;p&gt;&lt;embed-code &#10;file="$examples/first-model/src/test/java/io/spine/validation/docs/firstmodel/BankCardTest.java" &#10;fragment="invalid-digits"&gt;&#10;&lt;/embed-code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;assertThrows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;ValidationException&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;class&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;-&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;BankCard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;newBuilder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;setDigits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt